{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79 About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Blood Storm: Alien Purge</strong>, you play as Jia Hua, a rookie agent of the Federal Bureau of Anomalies (FBA).<br>A mission gone wrong leaves you trapped in an abandoned factory crawling with aliens, cybernetic zombies, and mutant horrors. To survive, you must blast your way through waves of enemies and uncover a dark government conspiracy lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines <strong>classic arcade-style rail shooting</strong> with modern 3D visuals. Success relies on precision aiming, quick reactions, and careful reload timing. Expect a fast-paced, adrenaline-fueled experience with around <strong>40 minutes of campaign content</strong>, designed for replayability and gradual skill improvement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-Style Rail Shooting</strong><br>Classic first-person rail shooter gameplay combined with modern 3D visuals. Easy to pick up but challenging to master, making it enjoyable for both newcomers and veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrenaline-Pumping Gunplay</strong><br>Carefully designed stages and enemy types deliver fast-paced firefights, smooth shooting mechanics, and moments of heart-racing intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Storytelling</strong><br>Follow rookie FBA agent Jia Hua as he uncovers the truth behind mysterious creatures and the dark conspiracies hidden inside the Bureau.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery &amp; Suspense</strong><br>Step by step, unravel the secrets buried in abandoned factories and underground bases, experiencing a tense and bizarre world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Difficulty Design</strong><br>Inspired by the hardcore spirit of the NES era, this game is designed with true challenge in mind.<br>Enemies have higher health, and only precise shots to their weak points deal critical damage. During combat, they will often hide their weak spots between attacks, requiring <strong>quick reflexes, sharp focus, and sound judgment</strong>.<br>With enough practice, you can achieve the legendary mastery of being <strong>\u201cone with the gun, like John Wick\u201d</strong>, earning the ultimate glory of a <strong>one-credit clear</strong>.<br>This is a game for those who seek a real challenge \u2014 <strong>fight like a true warrior!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2764\ufe0f From the Developers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for giving <strong>Blood Storm: Alien Purge</strong> a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483190/extras/f693de69b4d9d4fb8874e5f8f3eda749.poster.avif?t=1769488913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483190/extras/f693de69b4d9d4fb8874e5f8f3eda749.webm?t=1769488913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483190/extras/f693de69b4d9d4fb8874e5f8f3eda749.mp4?t=1769488913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483190/extras/a573662e73dd2b3cc405d3e204cba983.poster.avif?t=1769488913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483190/extras/a573662e73dd2b3cc405d3e204cba983.webm?t=1769488913\" typ